00:30:50.481 --> 00:30:52.350
Peach black tea, sweet tea.

00:30:52.350 --> 00:30:53.718
They weren't kidding, man, look at that.

00:30:53.718 --> 00:30:55.119
Lemon sweet tea

00:30:55.119 --> 00:30:57.222
