00:30:57.222 --> 00:30:59.557
Fruit punch, mango, guava.

00:30:59.557 --> 00:31:02.727
Energy, come on, herbal tonic.

00:31:02.727 --> 00:31:04.329
Herbal? This is herbal, guys? Yeah?

00:31:04.329 --> 00:31:06.731
7-Eleven also their own brand of ...

00:31:06.731 --> 00:31:08.733
are these considered energy drinks?

00:31:08.733 --> 00:31:10.368
The Gatorades and Powerades and the like.

00:31:10.368 --> 00:31:12.470
So Replenish, and of
course Replenish zero.

00:31:12.470 --> 00:31:14.639
